          body: 'A lawyer letter usually contains four layers: alleged facts, legal characterisation, demanded action, and implied consequences. Separate them before reacting. "Our client reserves all rights" is standard positioning; a deadline, threatened injunction, preservation notice, or settlement offer is more operationally important.'
